/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|We need to separate them first.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|You want to check the map?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|I'm fine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|I don't doubt it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_42.wav|Vertin|en|We arrived in Australia not long ago.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|It has grown larger and larger as your "lizard hypothesis" heated up. I'm sure the guards of Laplace will break in soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|Don't jump to the worst conclusion yet. Follow me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|People.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|But there is no evidence to prove that she's telling a lie.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|You are of great significance to Laplace. They don't want you to take any risks.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|I am the one and only reliable "bodyguard" who can keep you safe among all the others in the Foundation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|We missed the right junction. The roads are different from the map Mr. Slouch Hat gave us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|We have to stop him.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|It's called the Rolling Croc, with a hand drum made of crocodile skin hanging on the signboard.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_51.wav|Vertin|en|Ugh ...
