/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_53.wav|Vertin|en|... One may infer that she was shocked by the fire-vomiting and thus ... displayed abnormal behaviors.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|Relax, the symptoms may not last. Sensing "omens" doesn't always mean danger to arcanists.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|I'll protect it for you. Don't worry.
