/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|Don't let anyone out before I open it again!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|We have to put her out for now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|Considering Spathodea's identity, we do stand a chance.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|Mmm?!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|Sorry, I'm not quite with you. Perhaps you could start from what happened then.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|Ezra is worried about you, and so are we.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|Is it because she took part in too many events in the Stadium?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|And these symptoms were relieved soon after they left the Stadium.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|... The good news is, we are already a skilled fire brigade.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|And they happen to be here right now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_19.wav|Vertin|en|I'm more than willing to join you in bringing back the Games. It will be a wonderful new beginning.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|Ezra is indeed a he.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|The temperature here will get even higher at noon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|Wait.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|What do you mean "the present me"?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_23.wav|Vertin|en|Oh, thank you. He's my contact in Australia. We've been writing letters these days.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_24.wav|Vertin|en|They have something to do with people's lives. These marks have to mean something.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_25.wav|Vertin|en|Keep going, Ezra. You're very close …
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|Laplace has forwarded the Uluru Games application to the Foundation, and it has been moving smoothly in the system in the last two weeks. I heard that from Mr. Slouch Hat on the phone this morning.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_27.wav|Vertin|en|They believe it will be a good opportunity to build a positive image for arcanists, and it will strengthen the communication between them and humans. The Foundation is happy to see that happen.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_28.wav|Vertin|en|Huh?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_29.wav|Vertin|en|But the paperwork we are going to deal with ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|I have seen pictures of the Uluru Games in the school library collection a long time ago.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_30.wav|Vertin|en|Ezra has prepared plenty of Cooling Tablets and water in the medical kit for us. If anyone still suffers sunstroke, we also have the Budgerigar Coat as an emergency measure.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_31.wav|Vertin|en|No time to hesitate. Protect Spathodea and engage!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_32.wav|Vertin|en|But to be honest, I'm impressed by Ms. Spathodea's energy and passion for all these. She's ... Huh? Who are those people by her side?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|Bunny Bunny, take everyone back to the suitcase!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|I was not a fan of the routine physical fitness test at school, but I don't think any arcanist would say no to witnessing the revival of the once magnificent Games.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|After all, we're in a different age now, which means we can achieve much more than a sports game.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|I do have hopes for it. My wish to revive the Games is stronger than Ezra's, and my expectations for it are higher than Spathodea's.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_37.wav|Vertin|en|Like what you mentioned last night.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_38.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_39.wav|Vertin|en|Something very important? What is it?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_4.wav|Vertin|en|Her temperature ... is a bit lower than just now, but her condition is quite stable. I guess it's not a "reincarnator" reaction, but something else.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|Maybe they will lead us to the entrance to the Stadium.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|Desert Flannel? Where have you been?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|Is the conversation about your changes?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_45.wav|Vertin|en|Watch out, Regulus. You are falling down.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|These are murals. No, they are reliefs. All the marks are carved out of the wall.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|These carvings existed long before any murals, and they are rougher.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|Desert Flannel's dizziness is in remission. She's already well enough to deal with her business on the fax machine. Will it do harm to her physical condition?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_5.wav|Vertin|en|It's even more splendid than I thought, and ... more comfortable and pleasing.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_50.wav|Vertin|en|Anyone care to have some fresh air?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_51.wav|Vertin|en|Well, I happen to know many arcanists who meet your need.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_52.wav|Vertin|en|No, I don't think so. It just smells ... familiar here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_53.wav|Vertin|en|Spathodea, who are they?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|Relax, Desert Flannel. We've got help.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|Everyone, mind your steps and keep up!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|She's not even awake.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|Drunk, clouding of consciousness ... No, Regulus!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_10.wav|Vertin|en|Let's move, friends.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_11.wav|Vertin|en|Ulu? Are you alright?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_12.wav|Vertin|en|He's a hat ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_13.wav|Vertin|en|I see. We'll deal with this problem before we talk.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_14.wav|Vertin|en|My first thought ... Well, "There's a 'UFO' here."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_15.wav|Vertin|en|Not a number Makower can incite alone. Some of them must be his accomplices. I'm sure they are good at mobilizing, swindling, blackmailing and stuff ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_17.wav|Vertin|en|They have built the Uluru Guardians which consists of 31 arcanists and 29 humans. There are doctors, writers, taxi drivers, newsstand owners, and so on.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_19.wav|Vertin|en|So it's a kind of experience one must grow old enough to learn.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_2.wav|Vertin|en|"Showing Ezra what the world is like. Be right back."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_20.wav|Vertin|en|No response. Are they ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_21.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. aliEn T and I met in a very simple way.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_22.wav|Vertin|en|"Desert Flannel."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_23.wav|Vertin|en|I know there are spots with mysterious power in this world. They can provide a slim chance of survival in the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_25.wav|Vertin|en|That's almost the fastest they can do. Can we postpone it a bit more?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_26.wav|Vertin|en|I took a glance at the crowd. There are at least 3,500 of them out there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_27.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, a lot.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_28.wav|Vertin|en|The audience are all seated. No stampede or jostle, not to mention injury.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_29.wav|Vertin|en|Hi, it's Vertin.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_3.wav|Vertin|en|He's your enemy?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_30.wav|Vertin|en|The answer is much simpler than you think.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_31.wav|Vertin|en|It's a nice map.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_32.wav|Vertin|en|It shouldn't be left in halves. What do you think?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_33.wav|Vertin|en|Give me five minutes. They will no longer be a problem for us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_34.wav|Vertin|en|Spathodea, it's not all your fault.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_36.wav|Vertin|en|As well as a helping hand.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_37.wav|Vertin|en|And they are all among the audience of the Games.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_38.wav|Vertin|en|We've got a helping hand.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_39.wav|Vertin|en|That's right.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_4.wav|Vertin|en|Spathodea has decided to supervise the construction herself, and Ulu is now with her at the site. I'm wondering how you are doing with Ezra.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_40.wav|Vertin|en|The procedure is long and complicated. Besides, the safety reports were only submitted a few days ago, so it will take at least 20 days.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_41.wav|Vertin|en|"We shall run in the name of sportsmanship."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_42.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Desert Flannel, is Ezra still with you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_43.wav|Vertin|en|But the Uluru Stadium is still here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_44.wav|Vertin|en|You know him well?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_45.wav|Vertin|en|Fortunately, a lot of people went to the visitor window of the branch.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_47.wav|Vertin|en|They volunteered to station here to protect it, even at the cost of their own time and effort.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_48.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Desert Flannel?
