/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_5.wav|Vertin|en|Desert Flannel, you take care of Ezra. I'll follow the progress of the Foundation's examination.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_50.wav|Vertin|en|The current life expectancy is 50-75 years. I don't think I will ever reach your age ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_51.wav|Vertin|en|Thanks, Ulu. I'll request another raise of your accelerants from Laplace.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_52.wav|Vertin|en|And the Stadium is exactly one of them. Such a place ... will be desired by different forces one day. It's just a matter of time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_53.wav|Vertin|en|The Foundation has already launched the Uluru Guarding Project. It will be a long-term mission and involves a heavy workload, and the Australia branch doesn't have enough manpower for it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_6.wav|Vertin|en|That's why I want to keep it here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_7.wav|Vertin|en|Desert Flannel? Ezra? What's the hurry?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_8.wav|Vertin|en|Not in the room, I knew it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_5_wulu_part03_9.wav|Vertin|en|It was in the office of a Foundation branch, New Mexico, USA.
