/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_1_6_shuori_9.wav|Vertin|en|Think I had a dream. Many animals were jumping over a broken bridge.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|No. Thank you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|Understood.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Have you been working here since the opening of this place?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|Curiosity came over him, and he followed them to the cemetery.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|The photo of the dead seemed familiar.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|I see. This looks like the work of a Mummus. It's a critter commonly seen in the southern US. When they're frightened, they produce a fog-like gas from their respiratory trumpet.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_15.wav|Vertin|en|That man, Stefen. He clearly knows something. But he appears to be rather mentally unstable, and he's hostile towards me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|He's fainted.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|Erm, is that Ms. Tuesday?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|I do have one question.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|Before we left, TTT was telling me an urban myth about Texas.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|Not at all.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|You remember all the guests and their room numbers?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_21.wav|Vertin|en|Have we met?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_22.wav|Vertin|en|There was a mass evacuation at the Zeno base in Texas.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|Wait! Sir—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|Someone's casting arcane skills nearby.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|Oh, it's no trouble. In fact, I'm glad that we came here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|Got it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_27.wav|Vertin|en|Sir?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|Did she get in trouble?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|Hello?!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_3.wav|Vertin|en|The man dropped the girl off at a cemetery and drove on. It was late at night, so he was hoping to reach his destination quickly.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|Look, a piece of chocolate.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_32.wav|Vertin|en|Give me a moment. I have to take this. It's from the Foundation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_33.wav|Vertin|en|That man said he'd seen a "sheep-headed monster."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_34.wav|Vertin|en|Why don't you offer her your help? She needs it more than I do.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|Do you hear that? Sounds like a crying baby.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you for your kindness.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_37.wav|Vertin|en|How's business?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|Cash, please.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|Did you say your motel wasn't far from here?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|Have you seen a sheep-headed arcanist around?
