/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|At least he didn't take the luggage with him.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|Are you alright, Miss?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|Good decision.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, but the actions of one man don't negate all other calls for help.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|Madam Z cautioned me on this. I must be extra careful when dealing with people like him. Should make sure I have a backup plan in place before proceeding.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|Call me if anything happens.
