/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_57.wav|Vertin|en|Soon after, he saw a funeral procession going down the road.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_58.wav|Vertin|en|Are you alright?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_59.wav|Vertin|en|Her arcane skill.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|Sounds good.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_60.wav|Vertin|en|What's ...
