/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_62.wav|Vertin|en|The operator only mentioned an evacuation. It's still possible that some of them have stayed behind to keep the factory running.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|Still no sign of Lilya.
