/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|Don't worry. She'll check in later.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|S.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|I see. They didn't teach us about arrays so that we could use them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|The pattern's familiar. I've seen it somewhere before.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|It's a quote from a text on alchemy.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|So you can knock me out as soon as I turn my back to you?
