/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|That's it. That's the one I'm looking for.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_30.wav|Vertin|en|Is that an arcane array?
