/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Tuesday, can I ask you a question?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Tuesday?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|I'm good for now. Thank you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|when I was in school.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_37.wav|Vertin|en|Most of them dress in blue and black, some drool a fair bit, and most of them can't speak in full sentences.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_38.wav|Vertin|en|Please. We aren't accusing you of anything.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_39.wav|Vertin|en|There's something I want to ask you. I received a phone call earlier.
