/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|Lilya still hasn't come back. I must find someone else to help.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, I've definitely seen this before,
