/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|Blood was used as the medium for this array.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_44.wav|Vertin|en|Very well. But you'll have to look elsewhere, I'm afraid. There's no one but me in this room.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_45.wav|Vertin|en|The most notable feature is that they all wear masks shaped like hands. Have you seen any before?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_46.wav|Vertin|en|Before I let you investigate the room, I have one more question. You take jobs from people nearby, don't you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|And was there a sheep-headed arcanist among them?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|You know how to deal with this, right?
