/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_25.wav|Vertin|en|Why are you so obsessed with people's fears? Your hands have been trembling with excitement this whole time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_26.wav|Vertin|en|So you took it in? Some unknown, growing arcane consciousness that takes the form of a motel yet somehow also exists as a baby?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_27.wav|Vertin|en|Let's get out of here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_28.wav|Vertin|en|How do I pay your fee?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_29.wav|Vertin|en|The bad news is we've got a new problem. This motel is the manifestation of a living consciousness that constantly generates urban legends and spreads fear. It might turn into a supernatural arcanist in the future.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_3.wav|Vertin|en|But I'm not interested in this vile obsession of yours.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_30.wav|Vertin|en|Don't pull the trigger!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_31.wav|Vertin|en|I would advise you to wait until the Foundation staff arrive.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_32.wav|Vertin|en|Remember, what you see isn't real. You're still inside the motel, at least for now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_33.wav|Vertin|en|And although this ability has come too late for some, we still have a future to protect.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_34.wav|Vertin|en|We must report back to Madam Z about Urd.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_35.wav|Vertin|en|The Foundation staff will take care of it for you later. You can trust them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_36.wav|Vertin|en|Do you know someone called Argus?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_37.wav|Vertin|en|I can feel the energy fluctuations of teleportation rituals. It must be them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_38.wav|Vertin|en|But after leaving, some of them went mad or even committed suicide.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_39.wav|Vertin|en|I don't think it's the wisest choice to have this conversation while we're still inside a living thing.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_4.wav|Vertin|en|Obviously, luck wasn't on his side.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_40.wav|Vertin|en|Let's go, Lilya.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_41.wav|Vertin|en|Okay.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_42.wav|Vertin|en|It's too early to discuss that.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_43.wav|Vertin|en|Where is she? Where's Argus?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_44.wav|Vertin|en|Okay.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_45.wav|Vertin|en|Kayla?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_46.wav|Vertin|en|Mm?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_47.wav|Vertin|en|We can't leave yet.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_49.wav|Vertin|en|Goodbye.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_5.wav|Vertin|en|You should be thankful you've never seen it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_50.wav|Vertin|en|Calm down, Argus.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_51.wav|Vertin|en|I'm fine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_52.wav|Vertin|en|We can't let it grow here unchecked. We need the help of the Foundation to keep it under control.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_53.wav|Vertin|en|After the branch completes its procedures, you'll be sent to the headquarters for a more thorough assessment.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_54.wav|Vertin|en|What about her?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_55.wav|Vertin|en|Let's get out of here, Ms. Barbara.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_6.wav|Vertin|en|I have good news and bad news.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_7.wav|Vertin|en|Because the umbrella's here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_8.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Tuesday, this has to end.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_1_wangshi_part05_9.wav|Vertin|en|It's Stefen, a Zeno officer.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|As the Timekeeper of the St. Pavlov Foundation, I can assure you:
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|Surrender, Ms. Grace. Your lies will not succeed here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Please, everyone, remain calm.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|Looks like an ordinary flyer to me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, we must calm the situation before things escalate further.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|Get ready to engage with these Manus thugs.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|Not at all, Sonetto. It actually gave me the opportunity to try out X's latest invention—the Bouncing Bulb.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|Of course, I am. Also, Mr. Ulrich has invited us to attend the ceremony in Laplace.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|Metallic percussion sounds, sprinkled with screams of pain ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|It's very interesting, a little draining though.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Sonetto. And what a lovely saying.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|It's possible. The flyer proved that this ship has some kind of association with them. We need to stay vigilant.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_21.wav|Vertin|en|We are from the St. Pavlov Foundation—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_22.wav|Vertin|en|Everyone, whenever there's an imminent "Storm," my watch here starts a countdown, but there have been no signs of—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, Regulus, get the crowd out of here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|Huh?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|The "Storm" is NOT coming.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|Shall I give you a moment to get ready?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_27.wav|???|en|Come in.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|Now I see how the Manus kept themselves hidden.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|Our plan is to board the cruise as ordinary passengers.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_3.wav|Vertin|en|Before a cruel whip ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_30.wav|Vertin|en|Sorry to break it to you like this, Regulus, but today's our last day off.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|Someone's jamming the signal.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_32.wav|Vertin|en|There's no telling what else the Manus have up their sleeve. We need to call for support as soon as possible.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_33.wav|Vertin|en|An organization dedicated to the protection and rights of humans and arcanists.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_34.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus said she's made acquaintance with a crew member and has made sure to alter our profiles so we don't attract any unwanted attention.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. Ulrich, we're more than happy to assist with your mission.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|Stop them!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|After this mission, we should be able to apply for a field investigation in Italy.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|But let's focus on this mission first.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|May I borrow your communicator?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_42.wav|Vertin|en|The new era ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|Yet, my watch has shown no sign of an imminent "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. Ulrich, does Laplace possess any technology that could detect an imminent "Storm"?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|It's Manus Vindictae!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|We need to contact the Foundation. Now.
