/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|Pleasure's mine, Mr. Ulrich. I've heard good things about your work with Regulus.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|Your help is much appreciated all the same, Mr. Ulrich.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus, are you able to reach Mr. Ulrich?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_51.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto? What's the rush?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_52.wav|Vertin|en|The situation on the "Free Breeze" is still unclear. We don't know how many Manus Vindictae followers might be on board.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_53.wav|Vertin|en|It isn't about hurting them. She wants to recruit more followers.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_55.wav|Vertin|en|Good to see that you actually paid attention in our last group meeting, Regulus.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_56.wav|Vertin|en|There's something I need to verify.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_57.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Grace, you murdered that man.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_58.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, change of plan.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_59.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. Our priority is to bring the guests back to their senses.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|Is this really the disguise you went with?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_60.wav|Vertin|en|Did you make this, Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_61.wav|Vertin|en|That group over there seems unusually uptight.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_62.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Grace claimed that the "Storm" was coming, and she managed to accurately predict the occurrence of the anomaly outside.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_63.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Sonetto. But it isn't you that I need to convince. It's them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|Impossible!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_8.wav|Vertin|en|What she showed you won't happen here. Manus Vindictae are just trying to manipulate you into buying into their deception and hatred. Don't give in to this false fear!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|Just as I suspected. Communications are blocked.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|The people here know the truth about your masks. There's no sense trying to deceive them any longer!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|I'm certain that day will come, eventually.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|To help as many people survive as possible.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|My suitcase alone won't be able to transfer that many people in time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|But how did they know our internal frequency?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae have failed.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|We did it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|This is Vertin. Please come in.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|Their actions don't seem to be aimed at recruiting nor at passing through the "Storm." Rather, they seem to be aimed at ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|Southward.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_19.wav|Vertin|en|Then we're agreed, Mr. Ulrich.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|And this is one of them. If anything happens, someone can use it to track you down if you're in serious trouble, like if you've fallen into the sea.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|I agree with Regulus. Your plan is too reckless, Mr. Ulrich.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|I insist. We can't afford to lose anyone, Mr. Ulrich.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|Every face, every song, every brick from each house to the cathedral—will be different.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_23.wav|Vertin|en|However ...
