/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|The mask's influence has wormed its way deep into their brains. I'm afraid sedatogens won't be able to awaken their consciousness any longer.
