/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae use their masks to sift out their most loyal followers. Those who pass the trial can retain their personality and memories.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043_2_4_diqiu_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|Gentlemen, I'll need your assistance, too.
