/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_56.wav|Vertin|en|How about you, Anne? What do you wish to get?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_57.wav|Vertin|en|Of course.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_58.wav|Vertin|en|There are a lot of people and fantastic things out there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_59.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|When they stayed for long enough, after you ran out of all available games, they were no longer attractive to you and no longer adored by you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_60.wav|Vertin|en|Yeah, you defeated him, like a marvelous miracle.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_61.wav|Vertin|en|Good, they've set traps in front of the cabin. Sonetto!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_62.wav|Vertin|en|Not to wait for the monsters, but "summon" them to us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_63.wav|Vertin|en|We have dealt with more curses in the past two hours than many people do in their entire life.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_64.wav|Vertin|en|Hmm. I think, I currently don't have any wishes.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_65.wav|Vertin|en|You will see the world with us—the amazing and unique outside world.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_66.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Tooth Fairy, please take a look at this.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_67.wav|Vertin|en|But Jessica, where are the people who once chose to stay here?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_68.wav|Vertin|en|Watch out! Something is approaching.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_69.wav|Vertin|en|Noticed what?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|If it is a curse, then it is a curse prepared for us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_70.wav|Vertin|en|So the moss not only affects humans, it also works on arcanists.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_71.wav|Vertin|en|There are no enemies here. Everyone here is a member of our squad!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_72.wav|Vertin|en|Wait. The carcass of the giant critter is missing.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_73.wav|Vertin|en|If you are willing to come with me, you will have them all.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|Jessica, if I stay, what will you get me? Except for food and shelter, what else will you get me?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_hero5043lvhu1_2_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|The lighthouse is sinking. Everyone, move and leave now!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_1.wav|Vertin|en|It took you 5 minutes and 23 seconds to open the door. Longer than I expected.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_2.wav|Vertin|en|But I'm not afraid right now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_3.wav|Vertin|en|As you said, fear comes from the unknown.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_4.wav|Vertin|en|You're welcome to stay here with us for more, if you're interested.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_6.wav|Vertin|en|And as we learn about the unknown, we conquer fear.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/activityvoc_story_hero5043_wangshi_8.wav|Vertin|en|I've certainly had my fearful moments, and perhaps there'll be more to come.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/hero5043_activitystory_lvhu_1.wav|Vertin|en|It's a long story.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/hero5043_mainvoc_1.wav|Vertin|en|What ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/hero5043_mainvoc_2.wav|Vertin|en|Hrrn ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/hero5043_mainvoc_3.wav|Vertin|en|Hmm ... She's even softer than I'd expected.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/hero5043_mainvoc_4.wav|Vertin|en|So ... this isn't a dream, then.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|Careful! There's another gang of rioters! They're blocking the way ahead!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|You are a careful reader.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Look at the world through your own eyes!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|We need to take them down first. Sonetto, your assistance, please!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|You can see it too, which proves you're the one I'm looking for.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|Relax. I'm not going to take you to the Foundation. I simply ask that you go somewhere safe with me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_15.wav|Vertin|en|Meet me at the bookstore on Oxford Street.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|... also in Kingly Court.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|Found them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|Go ahead.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|She must've been in a rush, leaving all that behind.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|Her face has gone pale ... Let me check her out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|Enemy ahead. Now!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_21.wav|Vertin|en|You haven't seen the "Storm" yet, have you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_22.wav|Vertin|en|Enough! Stop running!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|*cough* ... Is anyone hurt?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|I'll help you out. Don't worry.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|What are you going to do after Regulus's registration? The "Storm" is about to come.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|Are you talking about Regulus of the APPLe?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_27.wav|Vertin|en|In ten minutes.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|If you don't go back now, it'll be too late.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|It's nothing. I have my own mission ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_30.wav|Vertin|en|I'm her friend. She left something.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|Misty Bubble Balls have an easily traceable scent. Sonetto will be here any minute.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_32.wav|Vertin|en|I see. Let's go, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_33.wav|Vertin|en|The "Storm" will arrive shortly.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto ... are you really going to continue the mission?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|The "Storm" is here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_37.wav|Vertin|en|Now everyone, get ready to break through!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus, I need you to brave the "Storm" with me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|Have you found out where Regulus usually spends her time? Or anyone who knows her?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|I need your help. So until you can give it to me, I'll help you out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, your assistance please.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|Now, push me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|I'll do my best to help before the "Storm" arrives.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|It's a Misty Bubble Ball. You know how to use it, right?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|Do you like the world outside, Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|Exactly. Isn't this the bookstore?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|*coughs* ... Protect your eyes ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you very much for your assistance.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|Shh! She's here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|Regulus, you're doing this too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|You know I'm not like you, Sonetto. You've trained your whole life to battle with arcanum. I ... took a different path ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|Indeed. We have 45 minutes.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_8.wav|Vertin|en|The breach is behind us. The alley towards King's Road!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|Fifty minutes left. Come on, let's move.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|Follow me. All the way down to the end of the path and into the depths.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|Our time is going backwards, Regulus.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|There's also something I need to find out for myself ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|... the FIFA World Player of the Year, who then became a mass idol.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|Before meeting you, I had done so many experiments.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|I realized that you could see what I see in this world. So ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|Close your eyes.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|I can't stand aside and watch you be taken away by Sonetto; have you disappear like the others in the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_19.wav|Vertin|en|This is my own will.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|At one point, I discovered that my suitcase was able to cut the "Storm" out. It can preserve items from the last era too, like these photos.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|It was the beginning of the month. There couldn't have been a full moon that day. The real moon was to your west ... There were two that night.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|A safe place. An "ark" ... sailing in the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|Maybe.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_24.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. I took this photo several days ago. He was selling Hoover upright vacuum cleaners in the West End and thought photos would help business, so he gladly posed for it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_25.wav|Vertin|en|So I tried putting newspapers, mushrooms, even Wapaloosies into the case. They all succeeded. However, when it came to the friends I had made in the last era ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|They're stories from a long, long time to come.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_27.wav|Vertin|en|... That is to say, I am the one who records the beginnings and ends of eras.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_28.wav|Vertin|en|When you were out at sea, broadcasting on the radio, Regulus cried out, "Shout it to the full moon!"
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_29.wav|Vertin|en|Say this with me ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|These photos date forward to 1999. My time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_30.wav|Vertin|en|I met her at a snack bar at 2 a.m. Her one-act play about the Trans-Antarctic Expedition was a real masterpiece.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_31.wav|Vertin|en|You've braved the "Storm." My experiment succeeded. Thank you for your help.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_32.wav|Vertin|en|Hold my hand. Let me take you into the suitcase.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|Not good. Seems our suitcase has been found.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|It's alright. It's just ... the end of an era.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|By critters maybe, or just someone passing by. Sorry, I need to leave for a while. Need to hide it somewhere safe.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|Relax, Regulus. I will tell you, but not here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_37.wav|Vertin|en|And you survived.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_38.wav|Vertin|en|I am the Timekeeper. I keep track of time in the outside world.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_4.wav|Vertin|en|Maybe I should just record the time ... Be a silent, emotionless observer ... Act as the Foundation has asked me to.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|I doubt I'll ever see them again.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|One last time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|I'm from the St. Pavlov Foundation—the same place as the investigators you just met. We actually grew up there together.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|It doesn't work on ordinary people.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_45.wav|Vertin|en|... The truth.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_46.wav|Vertin|en|"Ne iru milde en tiun bonan nokton."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|Please allow me to re-introduce myself.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|I decided to try it again.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|No one can follow us here. We can speak freely.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_5.wav|Vertin|en|At the countdown to the millennium, before the clock struck twelve, time reversed. We were sent back to the explosion of the supernova in the 80s, to the release of VHS ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|.. and to the 1960s, where I met you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|This is Julie, who once invited me to her house. Her bedroom wall was covered with posters of Rivaldo ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|This is Marion Smith, a single mother. She worried if she could afford to feed her child every night, but she never gave up her dream of being a writer.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter0_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|I failed.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|The outstanding human explorer. His research has formed the basis for understanding many applications of arcanum. Countless arcanists have benefited from his work.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|Please take this GPS device. I've pinged its location. Help will arrive soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, prepare to engage.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|Grab tight. I'm starting the engine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|Will—Will we be there soon?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|Don't worry. I'm generally a proponent of safe driving.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_15.wav|Vertin|en|My apologies that we can't stay with you until they arrive. I'm afraid we're on a time limit. Excuse us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|Yes?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|Looks like we've arrived.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|An old friend?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Sonetto. Let's take a rest before we set off again.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|Indeed. It's widely known that many members of the Amundsen family became explorers. Their passion was so strong that it's been recorded in arcanist textbooks.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|That's right.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_21.wav|Vertin|en|I know that name.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|They're warm on the inside.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|Let's take a look.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. It's an arcane suitcase. It's bigger on the inside. It can hold food, rooms, even arcanists themselves.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|And that's why you're reluctant to leave, even after all the misfortune you've encountered. Is that right?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_27.wav|Vertin|en|We have our reasons.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|At least now we can be sure that there are people around here, or there "were."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|Rolf Amundsen?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_3.wav|???|en|What's this?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_30.wav|Vertin|en|This station is close to the shore. There are many ways you could've got the attention of passing ships if you'd wanted to.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|A memory just came to me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_33.wav|Vertin|en|We need to catch up with Dr. Dores as soon as possible. Hold on tight, everyone. I'm going to speed up.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_34.wav|Vertin|en|It's like ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|It's said that your family holds a particular set of beliefs about the unsolved mysteries of the world, and that every one of you holds a passion for arcanum.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|Why didn't they give it to me themselves?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_37.wav|Vertin|en|I'm fine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|It's highly possible that the ritual will be held there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|Oh, and given that the communication equipment at this station isn't working ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|What are these towers, exactly?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|Actually, we're heading to the heart of Antarctica. Perhaps you'd be willing to offer us some advice?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_42.wav|Vertin|en|May I introduce you to Ms. Radio? She'll receive the signal from the rescue team for you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|Something else is off. There's gauze on the floor and brown powder around his wound.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|A gift? A ... suitcase?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|A person, to be specific.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|The further south we go and the colder the weather gets, the harder it is to shake this feeling of déjà vu.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|The body's bloodied, but the stethoscope is clean. It was put on afterwards.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|There's an odd mark carved into his forehead.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|I see. But I didn't expect there to be a research station all the way out here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|There must be a purpose behind these attacks.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_51.wav|Vertin|en|A stethoscope?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_52.wav|Vertin|en|Let's head further in.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_53.wav|Vertin|en|We're also here in pursuit of something.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_54.wav|Vertin|en|Nails?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_55.wav|Vertin|en|What are those snowdrifts ahead?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_56.wav|Vertin|en|Excuse me, is anybody there?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_57.wav|Vertin|en|Let's take it off and have a look.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_58.wav|Vertin|en|We're just passing by. We mean no harm. Is there anyone else at this station that can help us?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_59.wav|Vertin|en|What's this sticky substance on the ground?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|Ah, I get it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_60.wav|Vertin|en|And Manus Vindictae's hiding place.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_61.wav|Vertin|en|And we're searching for someone who may play a vital role in this ritual.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_62.wav|Vertin|en|Looks like somebody gave him first aid.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_63.wav|Vertin|en|Like I've been here before.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika, did something similar happen to your teammates?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_8.wav|Vertin|en|Are you familiar with Manus Vindictae?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|Who's it from?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|Dr. Dores.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|Signal's gone. I can't tell if it's an issue on his end or ours.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|I hope Ulrich has come across friends as reliable as these.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|No. No. It's gone.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|We trust you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae's ritual is affecting the day and night cycle.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Urd ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. If you've thought it through, I won't stand in your way. Just be careful, Mr. Ulrich.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|From the looks of the angle of the sun, we still have some time to catch up to her before it gets dark.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|Agreed. We can't afford to risk any more time in here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_19.wav|Vertin|en|Hop on their backs.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|I doubt they'd be able to come to our aid in time. Besides, with every passing minute, we fall that much further behind Dr. Dores.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|Are you ready to walk in darkness, ladies?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|Or perhaps, they're eliminating any "aliens"—in this case, humans—in the vicinity before they perform the ritual.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|I think I see her.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_23.wav|Vertin|en|Are you certain?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_24.wav|Vertin|en|Not an illusion.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_25.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, Nautika, we noticed it too. This is the sixth time we've passed this stone wall.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|I suggest we stay here and search the area. Perhaps we'll find something to point us in the right direction.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_27.wav|Vertin|en|Although we can't be sure whether she was guided here, let's assume that she was alone.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_28.wav|Vertin|en|I have an idea. In fact, the answer's right in front of us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, if we give them a moment to smell the stethoscope, they may be able to track down the scent left on it. Let's hope it works.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_30.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika, you're a capable reindeer-and-dog trainer, right?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_31.wav|Vertin|en|Exactly.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_32.wav|Vertin|en|I see. Thank you, Mr. Ulrich. This is exactly the information we needed.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|I suppose that makes sense.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Radio!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. She always covers her eyes with a patch or bandage.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|Still, we got what we needed: the ritual will take place in a sanctuary hidden in the volcano at the edge of the city ruins.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_37.wav|Vertin|en|We should keep moving.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_39.wav|Vertin|en|I had the same thought, but I don't sense any arcane fluctuations around here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_4.wav|Vertin|en|Come on, Nautika. Time to "hit the drum."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|And even if it were the season for polar day, the solar angle would still vary.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|Shh. Watch.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|That would be the safest choice, but according to Mr. Ulrich, the Foundation is tied up on the front lines.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. Due to the urgency of the situation, we were only able to grab a few documents.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_44.wav|Vertin|en|It was worth the risk.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_45.wav|Vertin|en|What is the answer that you're searching for?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_46.wav|Vertin|en|It's worth a try. We don't have any other ideas at the moment.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|I have a feeling that all our questions will be answered once we pass through that gate.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|I'm afraid comms are down.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|What are you looking at, Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_5.wav|Vertin|en|But they haven't made contact with us yet. It seems we won't be getting any more intel on the ritual from them anytime soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_51.wav|Vertin|en|If everything's gone to plan, the Foundation's spy should already be in Antarctica.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_52.wav|Vertin|en|We thought you'd have liked to look through them, had we not encountered those rabid dogs, so we took what we could before we left.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_53.wav|Vertin|en|Indeed. We've seen it rise and fall several times since we left from Tierra del Fuego.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_54.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. Ulrich?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_55.wav|Vertin|en|Whether these were left intentionally or not, this proves that we're heading in the right direction.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_57.wav|Vertin|en|That's right. This is Dr. Dores's typewriter.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|Think positively. Perhaps they'll just get there before us. Let's go after them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|It's okay, Sonetto. Nautika can come with me. We'll just look around the city's perimeter. You have my word.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|The sled dogs followed Dr. Dores's scent from the typewriter.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|That said, Ms. Radio and the sled dogs couldn't just vanish into thin air. There must be a hidden exit, or something else at play here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_1.wav|Vertin|en|We have to go through the city. Now, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_10.wav|Vertin|en|It's finer than snow and reflects the sunlight differently. It sticks to the skin and is bitter on the tongue.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_12.wav|Vertin|en|Come, Nautika!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_13.wav|Vertin|en|No. Who are you really? Kayla from the ranch? Captain Grace of the "Free Breeze"?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_16.wav|Vertin|en|I can't say for sure, but the owner wasn't exactly subtle about their interests.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_18.wav|Vertin|en|Any idea how it got there? And how the typewriter ended up lying in the snowfields?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_19.wav|Vertin|en|How about the powder we found on the typewriter?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_2.wav|Vertin|en|There was an array in Tuesday's Motel, which the Foundation confirmed to be part of a resurrection ritual. And here in Manus Vindictae's city, there's a manuscript about a revival potion.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_20.wav|Vertin|en|The Fountain of Youth? What else does it say?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_21.wav|Vertin|en|Two ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_22.wav|Vertin|en|No, I won't allow it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_23.wav|Vertin|en|And the only person they'd go to such lengths to bring back is—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_24.wav|Vertin|en|Three ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_26.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. Let's just watch where we step.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_27.wav|Vertin|en|Perhaps this is what their ritual is for. To bring back the dead.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_28.wav|Vertin|en|But if Manus Vindictae needs her to complete their ritual, we're on borrowed time. I'm afraid waiting for reinforcements is no longer an option.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_29.wav|Vertin|en|Grace? Is that you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_3.wav|Vertin|en|No. Not just any human.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_30.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Radio, could you get her on the comm?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_31.wav|Vertin|en|Alive and well, and you? Where's Nautika?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_33.wav|Vertin|en|Paracelsus ... Why does that name ring a bell?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_34.wav|Vertin|en|I've been meaning to ask: what is black algae, exactly?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_35.wav|Vertin|en|*coughing*
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_36.wav|Vertin|en|We'll find another way to enter the sanctuary.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_37.wav|Vertin|en|I don't hear any movement above us. Perhaps she's found a place to hide.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_38.wav|Vertin|en|Revive the dead ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_39.wav|Vertin|en|Don't provoke it. There's a chance it might just leave us be.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_4.wav|Vertin|en|This is an alchemist's chamber.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_40.wav|Vertin|en|That's one of Nautika's expedition team members.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_41.wav|Vertin|en|Did you leave it there? Were you giving directions to the Foundation's investigators?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_42.wav|Vertin|en|So which one are you now? What's your goal here?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_43.wav|Vertin|en|A creature that doesn't belong to land or water ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_45.wav|Vertin|en|When we make another offering.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_46.wav|Vertin|en|Ms. Radio, could you get Mr. Ulrich on the line? Perhaps he has another lead.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_48.wav|Vertin|en|Stay close, everyone. Let's head back to the exit of the labyrinth first.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_49.wav|Vertin|en|We need to get her out of there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_5.wav|Vertin|en|We can't just leave Nautika here! Sonetto!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_50.wav|Vertin|en|It's a big world, Ms. Stranger. There will always be a place for you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_51.wav|Vertin|en|No. That isn't water.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_52.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika, do you have any idea where we are?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_53.wav|Vertin|en|On our way here, we discovered a couple of items that I believe belong to Dr. Dores—a stethoscope and a typewriter.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_54.wav|Vertin|en|What?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_55.wav|Vertin|en|If we're going to find out anything about Manus Vindictae's ritual, the answers will be in this city.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_56.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, now!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_58.wav|Vertin|en|I'm fine. Don't worry.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_59.wav|Vertin|en|It seems they were intentionally left behind, like a series of signposts pointing us here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_6.wav|Vertin|en|It's fine, Sonetto. I have a few questions I'd like to ask.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_60.wav|Vertin|en|You wouldn't happen to know anything about these items, would you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_62.wav|Vertin|en|What exactly do you mean by that?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_63.wav|Vertin|en|On the count of three!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_64.wav|Vertin|en|Or ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_65.wav|Vertin|en|What's the purpose of this sacrifice?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_66.wav|Vertin|en|No more sacrifices.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_7.wav|Vertin|en|Strange. It's almost like they're in a state of unconsciousness.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part03_8.wav|Vertin|en|That's still unclear.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_1.wav|Vertin|en|Stay where you are!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_10.wav|Vertin|en|Wave your home a last goodbye.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_11.wav|Vertin|en|Threads?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_12.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika! Thank goodness.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_13.wav|Vertin|en|Oh, yes, my hat. Thank you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_14.wav|Vertin|en|Which way did I come from?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_15.wav|Vertin|en|I can't seem to grasp it. It's like a wisp of smoke.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_16.wav|Vertin|en|A thread ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_17.wav|Vertin|en|Must've been another one of Joseph's pranks. Thank you for bringing it back to me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_18.wav|Vertin|en|*steadying breath* Allow me to explain.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_19.wav|Vertin|en|But perhaps we should do it together, later, when the danger has subsided.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_2.wav|Vertin|en|It's ever so important to me. Where did you find it?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_20.wav|Vertin|en|I'm ... I'm here for you, and to stop Manus Vindictae's ritual.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_21.wav|Vertin|en|I didn't even realize it was gone.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_22.wav|Vertin|en|The sanctuary is just ahead. Manus Vindictae should be holding the ritual there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_23.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, I've definitely seen it before. This is the same mist from the lake in my suitcase.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_24.wav|Vertin|en|I ... I've been looking for you for a long time. I've followed your trail across the world.
