/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_26.wav|Vertin|en|I don't think so. Even though I don't remember her face, I know she isn't one of the instructors because I feel like I know her.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_27.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika, time to go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_28.wav|Vertin|en|Are you ... shaking?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_29.wav|Vertin|en|Where do things go when we forget them?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_3.wav|Vertin|en|When did that happen?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_30.wav|Vertin|en|It's a song I heard in a dream.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_31.wav|Vertin|en|Not at all. In fact, I can see them too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_32.wav|Vertin|en|A spinner at the Wheel. I've seen this before, but where?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_33.wav|Vertin|en|Yes.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_35.wav|Vertin|en|Stay with me—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_37.wav|Vertin|en|Is this worth more than your life?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_38.wav|Vertin|en|Let's get moving up the mountain. We may still find a lava tube that they overlooked, or at least we'll have a better signal to get in contact with Mr. Ulrich.
