/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_42.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_43.wav|Vertin|en|But when she looks at me, it feels warm, like being in the sun, like we are now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_45.wav|Vertin|en|No. That isn't right.
