/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_50.wav|Vertin|en|But sometimes, just before I fall asleep, I feel someone sit beside me. She strokes my hair and sings this song.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_51.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Sonetto. It's the safest place for them to stay now that we're getting deeper into the volcano.
