/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_57.wav|Vertin|en|Why?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part04_58.wav|Vertin|en|Though, strangely, I feel as though we've met before, a long time ago.
