/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part05_54.wav|Vertin|en|I'm searching for an answer, and I won't find it here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part05_55.wav|Vertin|en|Why must I endure this time and time again?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part05_56.wav|Vertin|en|But I've come to be at peace with that possibility.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part05_57.wav|Vertin|en|But it isn't for nothing.
