/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_53.wav|Vertin|en|That's far enough. Just stop right there, please. Don't—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_54.wav|Vertin|en|Agreed. Stay where you are, Dr. Dores. I'll—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_55.wav|Vertin|en|Nautika, this is our chance.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_56.wav|Vertin|en|So, to me, it's just ordinary water.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_58.wav|Vertin|en|If we can break these walls, we may be able to slow down her recovery. We can also use the falling debris to attack the believers below, and create more space for us to stay above the "Flood."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_59.wav|Vertin|en|Even though Arcana is gone, the ritual is still ongoing. She must have left the source of its power here in the sanctuary.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_6.wav|Vertin|en|Can you break through these walls?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_60.wav|Vertin|en|If I remember correctly, the ritual began right after Dr. Dores spun the Wheel.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_61.wav|Vertin|en|I cannot allow Manus Vindictae to wipe this world clean.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_62.wav|Vertin|en|Eye of the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_63.wav|Vertin|en|"The end is nigh" ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_64.wav|Vertin|en|Dr. Dores, no!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_7.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto? Nautika?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_8.wav|Vertin|en|The sanctuary should hold a little longer. I have to try again to stop this "Flood."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter10_part06_9.wav|Vertin|en|Don't act in haste, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_1.wav|Vertin|en|Good. But I'm not on either side. It seems like there's no need for me to stay. Why are you keeping me around?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_10.wav|Vertin|en|Of course. Your decisiveness saved the lives of many soldiers on the battlefield.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_11.wav|Vertin|en|I see. How's the progress so far?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_12.wav|Vertin|en|I'm not interested, just informed.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_13.wav|Vertin|en|Perhaps it's a chimera.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_14.wav|Vertin|en|Pardon me. Then it must be an elephant.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_15.wav|Vertin|en|We'll have other chances.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_16.wav|Vertin|en|It does appear so: the Vice President's office.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_17.wav|Vertin|en|Precisely. That's why the Doves prevailed, at least for now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_18.wav|Vertin|en|Were you waiting for me?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_19.wav|Vertin|en|Admiral Somme assigned this mission to you personally, not the whole team. Besides, Madam Z asked me to stay in the headquarters.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_2.wav|Vertin|en|I suppose because this "Storm" was different from the ones we've seen before.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_20.wav|Vertin|en|Sent from ... Lilya?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_21.wav|Vertin|en|An elephant.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_22.wav|Vertin|en|Did you notice something suspicious?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_23.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Mr. Creius. I'm afraid further introductions will have to wait; we're called elsewhere.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_24.wav|Vertin|en|Its claws are so sharp they might tear someone into pieces, shredding all rationality and hope.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_25.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae would only cooperate with the Foundation on something that was sure to fail.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_26.wav|Vertin|en|It's nothing. You seem a little anxious, Sonetto. What's the matter?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_27.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_28.wav|Vertin|en|I look forward to hearing what Madam Z has to say about it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_29.wav|Vertin|en|Where is she now? Does she have enough space to stretch?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_3.wav|Vertin|en|Could it be ... Igor? Lilya might be in trouble.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_30.wav|Vertin|en|What about Nautika and Ms. Stranger?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_31.wav|Vertin|en|I'm not on any side.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_32.wav|Vertin|en|Could it be that they're purposely diverting our attention?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_33.wav|Vertin|en|I think it will have to wait until after the tension clears.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_34.wav|Vertin|en|How do you mean?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_35.wav|Vertin|en|You have.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_37.wav|Vertin|en|Madam Z, we saw Irinei and Pedra at the door.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_38.wav|Vertin|en|Oh, yes, Creius. I was just listening in.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_39.wav|Vertin|en|This test isn't like the others from the Artificial Somnambulism we used to go through.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_4.wav|Vertin|en|Do we understand why history has changed?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_41.wav|Vertin|en|Something with an abnormal number of heads and limbs, growing larger in a disturbing manner, a bit like a Yateveo.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_42.wav|Vertin|en|But, won't this approach cause even more turbulence?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_43.wav|Vertin|en|It seems like nothing has changed.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_44.wav|Vertin|en|Come on in, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_45.wav|Vertin|en|Time to go, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_46.wav|Vertin|en|Understood. So, the "Storm" investigation team has returned?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_47.wav|Vertin|en|That's why Pedra and Irinei were here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_48.wav|Vertin|en|Let's go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_49.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, I think we'd better pay another visit to Madam Z.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_5.wav|Vertin|en|I also heard that the Doves agreed to further implement your "frontline contingency plan" after the Montpaix crisis was resolved.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_6.wav|Vertin|en|The shadow of death, where a devil lurks within.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_7.wav|Vertin|en|Understood.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_8.wav|Vertin|en|As we arrived, I heard Irinei call Pedra a "Pacifist." Does Irinei disagree with the Foundation's policy regarding the war?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter11_9.wav|Vertin|en|Let's head that way, then.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|Me. The Su-02ве assigned to you is the property of Team Timekeeper.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|Many of your cavalrymen are locals from the era. What do they think of Igor?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Madam Z. I'll do my best to return before the war breaks out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|Don't give me that look, Lilya. Madam Z approved it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|There's a place in the city called the Amber Room. It's said to hold an important clue about the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, you must try this pickled watermelon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_15.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, it was just what we needed, madam.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|Good afternoon, madam. I'm Vertin, Timekeeper of the Foundation. And this is Sonetto, my assistant.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|I understand.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|Commander, wait.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|It's hard to say.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|I'm sorry. I didn't receive any information on that matter. But I'll keep an eye out for you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|The price.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_22.wav|Vertin|en|As for this Golden Famine, I will try my best to give it a thorough investigation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|One 02 costs nearly triple the amount of an 01, or even more.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|Anything I can help you with, Commander?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|Don't worry. You're still on Team Timekeeper. Your new uniform's just for easy identification while you're acting as flight captain.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|Locating Urd has been my primary mission since the eighth "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_27.wav|Vertin|en|It really is delicious, madam. Quite different from any I've ever tasted. Might I ask how you made it?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|Please, call me Vertin, madam.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|I'm not sure how much it will help, but I heard reinforcements are on the way.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_3.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. I'll complete my mission quickly, hopefully before any conflict arises.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_30.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. Irinei said that this is the Su-02ве's combat debut. He hopes to hear some feedback from you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|The reason for this phenomenon still remains unknown.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_32.wav|Vertin|en|Creius privately conveyed to me a message about Urd. It said there's some information to be gleaned about her in Bereggrad. I'm not sure how dependable it is.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_34.wav|Vertin|en|That's a relief.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|How could Ms. Galina be your mother?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|However, observations have shown that each of them has a complete memory, identity, and social relations. Their independent will is undeniable. We can't force them to be the person we think they are.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_37.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Madam Z. I'm ready for whatever lies ahead.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|But since it concerns Urd's whereabouts, I have no choice but to go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|What's the Committee's attitude towards Igor now?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_4.wav|Vertin|en|I applied for it. There's something I need to find in Bereggrad.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|Arcanists?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|I'm glad you figured it out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_42.wav|Vertin|en|Sorry, I was just thinking about something. Do you mean to say that your home is in Tamarovka?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|A mission that may prove useful to the Foundation, don't you think?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|Lilya, Committee member Irinei asks if you'll serve as its temporary captain. What do you say?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|I need to know. Will you follow Zeno's orders and lead your army to Bereggrad?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|Commander Ivan, it's a pleasure to meet you. If you could, a brief walk-through of the situation in Bereggrad and the surrounding areas would be most helpful.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. See you later, Lilya.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|I've never personally dealt with such a thing. Perhaps I'll have an answer if I do.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|Does it sound familiar at all, Commander?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|No, this unit belongs to the Foundation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_51.wav|Vertin|en|Please accept my official application to travel to Bereggrad.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|From what I do understand, you are a survivor of the first "Storm." You've lived through all these eras too. I don't see the difference.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|The newly formed Flying Witch Company will arrive soon, along with a new broomstick for Lilya.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_8.wav|Vertin|en|I have no power to change your decision, but I have a mission here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|I see Lilya.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|The immunity range expanded. So this isn't the center of the Amber Room?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|Why are you here? This isn't reality. I can feel it. Where are you really? Where can I find you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|I'm still not sure if you're telling the truth, but thank you for bringing me here, Igor.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|Before? When they dug the tunnel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|In other words, the last time you saw the Urd you knew was before the first "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|You and Marsha can just wait for me here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|Did you ever consider finding out what was going on?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, Marsha?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, I'm fine. Just give me one more minute.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|Me?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_19.wav|Vertin|en|Mum?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|How much more do you know?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|A metro station. Looks like Cold War period. What's it doing here?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|How long was I down there? 15 minutes, right?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|In Antarctica?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_24.wav|Vertin|en|Were they not registered?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_25.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, you're the only one who knows the details of the mission besides myself. One of us should stay in a safe place.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|You communicated with Arcana after her death?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_27.wav|Vertin|en|I see. I'll make the decision.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_28.wav|Vertin|en|Alright.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_29.wav|Vertin|en|Why make a deal with Arcana if just to avoid the "Storm"? The Foundation already provides you shelter.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. I accept Igor's invitation, and I request the commander join me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_31.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae held its first space-time ritual on December 31st, 1999.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_32.wav|Vertin|en|It's okay. I'm not hurt. Just a bit dizzy.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|You know about the Amber Room too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|The Foundation found Urd that long ago?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|That project still caused harm to tourists at the Green Lake Campsite and the surrounding residents.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|To ensure the safety of both parties, I suggest we each bring our own bodyguards. Lilya will be ours.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_38.wav|Vertin|en|Underneath?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_39.wav|Vertin|en|I understand your concerns. But either way, I'll meet him.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_4.wav|Vertin|en|What's happening? Is Bereggrad ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|Then, what ultimately led to your betrayal?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|What are your thoughts, Commander?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|I feel the same, Igor. What did you want to talk about?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|What's that light ahead?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_44.wav|Vertin|en|A laboratory built in collaboration between the Foundation and Zeno?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_45.wav|Vertin|en|Arcana needed Urd to complete her resurrection ritual. What did you need?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_46.wav|Vertin|en|Er ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|They could easily have reached us through such devices. Given this message was brought by one of his most trusted subordinates ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|It's alright, Sonetto. Only Igor and I are allowed in the Amber Room. That was the deal.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|I will, Lilya. Have a good flight.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_5.wav|Vertin|en|She provided us valuable support. I simply returned the favor.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_50.wav|Vertin|en|The material's similar to the Tear of Comala.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_51.wav|Vertin|en|I don't think it's negotiable.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|Igor has the information I need.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|I currently have almost no information on my mission. I'd like to know what he has to say, even if it's a lie.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, Mr. Duncan in São Paulo. His appearance matched an acquaintance of mine, a man I saw dissolve in the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|She could've stayed in the safe zone, couldn't she?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_1.wav|Vertin|en|My condolences.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_10.wav|Vertin|en|No, whatever I saw wasn't footage.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_12.wav|Vertin|en|Ah!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_13.wav|Vertin|en|I saw other things, too, but they were blurry and fragmented.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_14.wav|Vertin|en|Let's make the most of our time, Mr. Irinei, before our absence draws unnecessary attention.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_15.wav|Vertin|en|It's heavy.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_16.wav|Vertin|en|Good point. I'll be sure to return to the Amber Room only after you've defeated Krutov.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_17.wav|Vertin|en|Is it really you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_18.wav|Vertin|en|Around midnight, the command post lost contact with the frontline cavalry.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_19.wav|Vertin|en|I have to enter the Amber Room once more to make sense of what I saw.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_2.wav|Vertin|en|She was being put through some kind of disturbing experiment, and for a brief moment, she caught sight of me. She walked towards me, then vanished.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_20.wav|Vertin|en|Mr. Igor.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_22.wav|Vertin|en|So you're suggesting ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_23.wav|Vertin|en|Urd sat here. I wanted to try it myself.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_24.wav|Vertin|en|I'm still the Timekeeper of the St. Pavlov Foundation. You're betting your life and freedom on nothing more than my favor.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_25.wav|Vertin|en|For the time being, yes, until Krutov is defeated.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_26.wav|Vertin|en|What is it that you want?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_27.wav|Vertin|en|A soldier came to me earlier today. He seemed to think a Foundation member would have a higher chance of surviving the battle and asked me to deliver a letter to his brother on the Western Front.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_28.wav|Vertin|en|Some documents on the experiment. The person who told me about this room might be interested.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_29.wav|Vertin|en|Commander Ivan invited me to his home in Tamarovka for a lunch. A lady hosted us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_3.wav|Vertin|en|What about you, Mr. Igor? Did you write anything?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_30.wav|Vertin|en|But you chose to walk away.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_31.wav|Vertin|en|What have you been through?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_32.wav|Vertin|en|And you tracked her down, only to find she'd become someone else, an investigative journalist, a humanitarian doctor, anything but the identity you were hoping for.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_33.wav|Vertin|en|You tried every method to force that version of her, a blind woman you had no need of, into becoming Urd again, the one from 1999.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_34.wav|Vertin|en|They ran the experiment over and over, each time Urd suffering immense pain. It all seemed designed to transform her into someone else.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_35.wav|Vertin|en|I felt like I'd been put into some kind of experiment. But it wasn't me. It was Urd.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_36.wav|Vertin|en|I managed to recover documents detailing the experiment's main procedures. However ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_38.wav|Vertin|en|Think nothing of it. I was prepared for the risks. Besides, Sonetto and Marsha were there to help me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_39.wav|Vertin|en|I saw a pure white room, a kind of white I've never seen before. And Urd ... She was sat in a chair at the center of it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_4.wav|Vertin|en|There's something I'd like to know, too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_40.wav|Vertin|en|But if you mean to ask about Urd specifically, I haven't learned anything more than I did on my first visit.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_41.wav|Vertin|en|I didn't find anything signiﬁcant about Urd.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_42.wav|Vertin|en|But you managed to build your own ark, didn't you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_44.wav|Vertin|en|Then, did Commander Ivan request shelter for her from the "Storm"?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_45.wav|Vertin|en|I know someone who would be deeply upset were you to die here. She intends to end your life with her own hands.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_46.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto and I have been trying to contact you for the past hour.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_47.wav|Vertin|en|She was struggling, as if she were in pain. I wanted to help, but I couldn't reach her.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_48.wav|Vertin|en|Igor, do you also want to return to the era before the "Storm"?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_49.wav|Vertin|en|We haven't heard anything from Bereggrad either.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_5.wav|Vertin|en|Is Igor marching with his army?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_50.wav|Vertin|en|What did you do to her?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_51.wav|Vertin|en|Where are you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_52.wav|Vertin|en|They've assigned her an instructor to work on her dice game obsession.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_53.wav|Vertin|en|I believe it was Urd. She seemed unsure of that herself. There were others there trying to convince her of her own identity.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_54.wav|Vertin|en|Was that your goal to find her and end all this?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_55.wav|Vertin|en|We've got some bad news of our own.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_56.wav|Vertin|en|You were there. What do you know about the experiments in this room? What did they want from her?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_57.wav|Vertin|en|He introduced her as his "mother," but something seemed off.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_58.wav|Vertin|en|She's made somewhat of a life for herself at the Foundation. Made friends and got into some trouble.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_6.wav|Vertin|en|You could say that. She isn't allowed to return to her position as a soldier yet, not until Zeno's review is finished.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_7.wav|Vertin|en|One day, I'll uncover the truth about the "Storm," for everyone's sake, for my mother.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_8.wav|Vertin|en|Who are you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter12_part03_9.wav|Vertin|en|Are you alright, Lilya?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_1.wav|Vertin|en|What happened to Matilda, Merel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_10.wav|Vertin|en|Please, call me Vertin.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_11.wav|Vertin|en|Will you be working on this project too?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_12.wav|Vertin|en|No need. Just go and find Matilda at the ceremony hall. She'll tell you what to do before I arrive.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_13.wav|Vertin|en|And to make matters worse, I don't have my Suitcase. If things go wrong, you could all be infected with the Storm Syndrome.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_14.wav|Vertin|en|How's Matilda doing?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_15.wav|Vertin|en|It's good to see you again, Marsha.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_16.wav|Vertin|en|Here it is. Let's go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_17.wav|Vertin|en|Is the research team here at the Foundation?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_18.wav|Vertin|en|The side entrance is right ahead. Keep going.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_19.wav|Vertin|en|Merel and Matilda are already engaged in the fighting.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_2.wav|Vertin|en|As it happens, I wasn't in class for most of ninth grade.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_20.wav|Vertin|en|If only Ms. Tooth Fairy weren't at the UK branch with Flutterpage right now.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_21.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you. I'll treat it with the utmost care.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_22.wav|Vertin|en|I still haven't.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_23.wav|Vertin|en|Nothing. Let's get inside.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_24.wav|Vertin|en|With any luck, we'll find something useful, or at least some other people.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_25.wav|Vertin|en|I did. But I don't quite know how to describe it. It was almost like the sound of sinking quicksand?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_26.wav|Vertin|en|Stay calm and keep your eyes open. Watch your step.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_27.wav|Vertin|en|It's been a while, Eagle. I understand you've joined Laplace.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_28.wav|Vertin|en|Merel, take cover!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_29.wav|Vertin|en|I think I've made contact with similar powers before. I'm not sure what it is, but I know it could be very dangerous.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_3.wav|Vertin|en|Manus Vindictae are attacking the SPDM?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_30.wav|Vertin|en|Just Vertin is fine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_31.wav|Vertin|en|If combat breaks out, I'll do what I can to protect Matilda and Beverly.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_32.wav|Vertin|en|The view was much more enjoyable before the hedges grew into walls like this.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_33.wav|Vertin|en|We take them down. And if there are too many of them, we'll pass through it to the clinic. We need to take Matilda there anyway.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_34.wav|Vertin|en|I would be in there right next to Creius if they wanted to investigate us as well.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_35.wav|Vertin|en|No. The risk is too high.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_36.wav|Vertin|en|The SPDM has taken in a large number of "Storm" orphans in the last few months, and they're preparing for next term's opening ceremony.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_37.wav|Vertin|en|But I don't imagine we'd make it that far with a comatose patient and a child.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_38.wav|Vertin|en|So you're saying I can use this device to "hear" what's inside the cube.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_39.wav|Vertin|en|It's a pleasure, Marguerite.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_40.wav|Vertin|en|Our best choice is the library. It's close by and "Storm"-proof.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_41.wav|Vertin|en|She's wounded. Could you find a quiet room and help me move her there? She may have suffered some trauma to her head, so we need to be very careful.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_42.wav|Vertin|en|The Foundation hasn't quizzed me on anything since I submitted my report on the Don Operation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_43.wav|Vertin|en|Alright.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_44.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. They're all in the Foundation's guest rooms. I've checked every nook and cranny to ensure no one was left behind.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_45.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. It was exactly as I wrote in my report.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_46.wav|Vertin|en|There's no time to clear debris. We'll have to move above ground.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_47.wav|Vertin|en|Is there something wrong, Merel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_48.wav|Vertin|en|I'm fine. My ears are ringing, but that's all.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_49.wav|Vertin|en|I see. Well, I suppose there's only one way to find out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_5.wav|Vertin|en|I'm sure it isn't anything too serious. I believe the Committee only wants to collect as much intelligence as possible before the next "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_50.wav|Vertin|en|Sorry, I can't. I just received a message. There's something I need to handle back at headquarters before I go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_51.wav|Vertin|en|We need a faster way to get there.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_52.wav|Vertin|en|Take it as a good chance to revisit, then. Sonetto and I will join you soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_53.wav|Vertin|en|Normally, I'd suggest the central watchtower. It's where the instructors used to tell us to go in case of emergencies.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_54.wav|Vertin|en|You still look pale, Ms. Stranger.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_55.wav|Vertin|en|I'll trust you both to handle whatever stands in our way.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_56.wav|Vertin|en|Is there something wrong, Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_57.wav|Vertin|en|It's amazingly lifelike. The arcane skill you cast on it must be sophisticated.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_58.wav|Vertin|en|With our shortages in manpower, they've been recalling any available alumni to assist, including Merel and me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_59.wav|Vertin|en|Hm? Anything else I can help you with?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_6.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, but don't worry. The Foundation has already begun recalling its staff, and you'll be safe here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_60.wav|Vertin|en|Alright. Grab Beverly, and let's move.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_61.wav|Vertin|en|Still, there should be medical staff on-site at the school. Let's move Matilda somewhere safe and start looking.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_62.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. She's an investigator now—a "star" investigator, she'll insist. She'll also be helping out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_63.wav|Vertin|en|In fact, you're early, miss. But I must confess, I was never all that timely before becoming the Timekeeper.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_64.wav|Vertin|en|No. The clock is ticking. We can't afford to wait.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_7.wav|Vertin|en|I'm used to it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_8.wav|Vertin|en|Has the Foundation assigned you a new job already? I thought you'd want to rest for a while longer.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part01_9.wav|Vertin|en|The plan is settled then. We'd better get moving. The "Storm" waits for no one.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_1.wav|Vertin|en|I've already applied the alchemical compound Ms. Marguerite gave me. She said it will begin to dismantle the shell as soon as the incantation is recited.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_10.wav|Vertin|en|I'm not certain. There was a mist or dust, and I heard a voice.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_11.wav|Vertin|en|It's possible that it could generate an immunity zone. But ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_12.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto? Where are you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_13.wav|Vertin|en|Igor managed to protect his entire army from the "Flood" in Antarctica, and I believe he did it with the power of this cube.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_14.wav|Vertin|en|At this rate, the library will be exposed ten minutes before the "Storm" arrives.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_15.wav|Vertin|en|We haven't seen any signs of the instructors nor the school security. They may have retreated into the central watchtower, but if that's the case, I don't understand why they would send the children here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_16.wav|Vertin|en|It said I already knew how to gain protection from the "boon." Then it spoke an incantation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_17.wav|Vertin|en|But if I can make it work, it could shield us all from the "Storm." I'd be saving not just you two, but all the students here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_18.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, where are—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_2.wav|Vertin|en|I'm not sure. It's like I've been hit by a flashbang. But I'll manage.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_20.wav|Vertin|en|No. I can't see anything. It's too dark.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_21.wav|Vertin|en|Rightful receiver? Then why was it in Arcana's possession? And why was it given to Igor?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_22.wav|Vertin|en|But you're not Arcana.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_23.wav|Vertin|en|It's time. Let's go, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_24.wav|Vertin|en|The good news is most of the students are accounted for within the library, and it's secure for now. But, that's basically where the good news ends.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_25.wav|Vertin|en|What are you expecting me to do, then?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_26.wav|Vertin|en|Yes. Its radius has reduced by 30 meters in the last 15 minutes. It's shrinking even faster than I'd anticipated.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_27.wav|Vertin|en|It's calling out to us. I hear my name and yours, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_28.wav|Vertin|en|Perhaps on another day I would be willing to solve your riddles, but not now. I want a clear answer.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_29.wav|Vertin|en|The convoy should've arrived by now, but there's no sign of them. I haven't been able to reach headquarters either.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_3.wav|Vertin|en|As for the library, it's only safe because the Dove in the central watchtower is still operational.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_30.wav|Vertin|en|We wait.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_31.wav|Vertin|en|I admire your courage, Merel, truly.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_32.wav|Vertin|en|It's more than alright. It's only natural that people would start rumors with me coming here so rarely.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_33.wav|Vertin|en|Then this can't truly be reality. It's like what happened in the Amber Room.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_34.wav|Vertin|en|Who are you? Where's Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_35.wav|Vertin|en|But the voice ... It sounds just like mine.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_36.wav|Vertin|en|Your voice ... I've heard it before, through the monitor.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_37.wav|Vertin|en|You have to get them to the central tower before the library is exposed to the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_38.wav|Vertin|en|So you say, but I've had remarkably little luck understanding either lately.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_39.wav|Vertin|en|You are the true creator of this "boon."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_4.wav|Vertin|en|We've viewed what we can from the windows in the reading room. It seems impossible to reach the central watchtower safely.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_40.wav|Vertin|en|It's an item Igor gave me during the Don Operation.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_41.wav|Vertin|en|The Foundation's reinforcements should be here any minute. They'll have brought enough Equilibrium Umbrellas for everyone.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_42.wav|Vertin|en|We meet here again before the "Storm." And whatever happens, we move forward together.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_43.wav|Vertin|en|You are the true creator of this "boon."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_46.wav|Vertin|en|Unlock the leaden secret.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_47.wav|Vertin|en|You sound different.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_48.wav|Vertin|en|I hear something. A voice. Someone's calling out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_49.wav|Vertin|en|Then we attempt to reach the central watchtower, assuming the Manus hasn't destroyed the Dove there too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_5.wav|Vertin|en|The flow of time has been disrupted.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_50.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, I'm the Vertin you've heard about. But I was never expelled.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_51.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_52.wav|Vertin|en|All four corner watchtowers are damaged, and I believe their Shelter Doves have been disabled.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_53.wav|Vertin|en|Vertin is just fine, Lavender.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_54.wav|Vertin|en|Could you tell me more about the situation here? We need all the details.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_55.wav|Vertin|en|The campus is crawling with Manus believers, and that's just the ones we can see. I doubt we could even make it as far as the central square.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_56.wav|Vertin|en|I'm afraid we have to prepare for the worst.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_57.wav|Vertin|en|You speak as though you know me. Have we met before?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_58.wav|Vertin|en|I know how impossible it must sound.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_59.wav|Vertin|en|That's why I called you here. We don't have the luxury of waiting for rescue anymore. I've decided to see whether the "boon" can be of any use.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_6.wav|Vertin|en|But I want to see for myself. I have to try.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_60.wav|Vertin|en|Of course. Merel, can I ask you to wait here? Someone has to look after the students if we don't make it back.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_61.wav|Vertin|en|I'm afraid we can't. The central tower's immunity range is shrinking.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_62.wav|Vertin|en|Go then. I trust you. And I need you to trust me, too.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_63.wav|Vertin|en|Even so, it may be our last hope to save everyone here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_64.wav|Vertin|en|Vekiĝu en la regno de mortemuloj.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_7.wav|Vertin|en|Unfortunately, if I'm correct, the library will be exposed before the "Storm" arrives.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_8.wav|Vertin|en|Igor believed that I was meant to have it. He was absolutely certain, though I still don't understand why.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part02_9.wav|Vertin|en|Igor was promised that the "boon" would protect him, but it didn't. Will that happen to me as well?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_1.wav|Vertin|en|It won't open from this side. Just as I thought.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_10.wav|Vertin|en|"It's an item Igor gave me during the Don Operation."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_11.wav|Vertin|en|Then we need to jump out of it. Just trust me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_12.wav|Vertin|en|We did it, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_13.wav|Vertin|en|I tried to dispel the mist around her, but then she just disappeared.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_14.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, this way. This is our way out.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_15.wav|Vertin|en|I think so.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_16.wav|Vertin|en|Which way am I facing, Sonetto? What's in this direction?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_17.wav|Vertin|en|There's a light, a golden thread. I can feel it, feel her.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_18.wav|Vertin|en|I know how to get out. Sonetto, lead me to the gate.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_2.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, please. And tell me what's behind it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_20.wav|Vertin|en|Mmm?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_21.wav|Vertin|en|"It's possible that it could generate an immunity zone. But ..."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_22.wav|Vertin|en|I've found a shelter strong enough for all of us.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_23.wav|Vertin|en|Why are they revealing themselves to me?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_24.wav|Vertin|en|I can see again. It seems we've made it back to reality.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_25.wav|Vertin|en|I ... Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_26.wav|Vertin|en|At headquarters, inside the Committee Building. I think I know why the Foundation never sent more reinforcements to the school.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_27.wav|Vertin|en|Wait, Sonetto.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_28.wav|Vertin|en|It's Merel.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_29.wav|Vertin|en|She spoke to me. She said, "Welcome back."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_3.wav|Vertin|en|Let's get out of here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_30.wav|Vertin|en|One day, I will uncover its secret.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_32.wav|Vertin|en|Good. Then this thread is leading us to exactly where we need to be.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_33.wav|Vertin|en|Which means we need to leave at the same time.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_34.wav|Vertin|en|But there's only three minutes left before the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_35.wav|Vertin|en|It's Arcana. She's here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_36.wav|Vertin|en|Do you know where we are?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_37.wav|Vertin|en|What do you see?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_38.wav|Vertin|en|The gate can only be opened from the other side. Someone has to come in first.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_39.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, where am I facing?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_4.wav|Vertin|en|Things will be alright now, Lavender.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_40.wav|Vertin|en|Let's try following Merel's thread.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_41.wav|Vertin|en|The thread's tangled. Merel may be in trouble. But her knot isn't anywhere close.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_42.wav|Vertin|en|It doesn't feel right. I don't understand what I did.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_43.wav|Vertin|en|I just know. I can't explain how.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_44.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_45.wav|Vertin|en|And the future revealed itself before me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_46.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_47.wav|Vertin|en|What are they? I can touch them, even pluck them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_48.wav|Vertin|en|Then, they're about to ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_49.wav|Vertin|en|Arcana has retreated.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_5.wav|Vertin|en|My sight's restored. I can see again.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_50.wav|Vertin|en|Lavender?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_51.wav|Vertin|en|These threads, the woven net ... I've seen this before.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_52.wav|Vertin|en|Then this maze can lead us to Foundation headquarters.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_53.wav|Vertin|en|"It's time. Let's go, Sonetto."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_54.wav|Vertin|en|Is this another game of yours, Arcana?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_55.wav|Vertin|en|I repeated the incantation, but I have no idea if it worked. We need to find a way out of this timeline anomaly if we're to know if it had any effect.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_56.wav|Vertin|en|Let's get out of here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_57.wav|Vertin|en|How's everything in the library? Is everyone alright?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_58.wav|Vertin|en|Take my hand. I'll guide us. You clear the way.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_59.wav|Vertin|en|Come in, Sonetto. Vertin, you have to bring Sonetto with you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_6.wav|Vertin|en|That was the last knot.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_60.wav|Vertin|en|No. This isn't right.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_61.wav|Vertin|en|"We meet here again before the 'Storm.' And whatever happens, we move forward together."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_62.wav|Vertin|en|There we go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_63.wav|Vertin|en|I think I've found a path. Let me try something.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part03_8.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, we can figure things out later. Let's just find a way back first.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_1.wav|Vertin|en|You'd have stopped me by now if the book said they're poisonous. I think we can live a little.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_10.wav|Vertin|en|We're fine. Sorry. Just a little shaken.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_11.wav|Vertin|en|It's been a pleasure. But we should probably get back to looking for our friend.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_12.wav|Vertin|en|Matilda, you're awake.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_13.wav|Vertin|en|Not just us. But Sonetto and I always travel together.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_14.wav|Vertin|en|Rhiannon ...
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_15.wav|Vertin|en|These are no ordinary brambles.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_16.wav|Vertin|en|Of course. We'll leave you to it.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_17.wav|Vertin|en|Merel! No!
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_18.wav|Vertin|en|Our work keeps us traveling constantly, like now. If you stay on the road long enough, a bit of wear and tear is inevitable.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_19.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, let's go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_2.wav|Vertin|en|Vekiĝu en la regno de mortemuloj.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_20.wav|Vertin|en|Not to worry. I think I know a way in.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_21.wav|Vertin|en|*sigh* We'll talk more once you're feeling better.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_22.wav|Vertin|en|Merel.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_23.wav|Vertin|en|We've visited every town nearby and come up empty. This bit of folklore could be our last chance.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_24.wav|Vertin|en|They've already finished rebuilding here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_25.wav|Vertin|en|Ugh.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_26.wav|Vertin|en|Have you ever thought about it?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_28.wav|Vertin|en|Of course not, which is precisely why we picked one with silly anecdotes on arcanum on the back.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_29.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_3.wav|Vertin|en|Come, Sonetto. Follow me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_30.wav|Vertin|en|I've seen so many people vanish in the "Storm," but this time it was different. I saw a golden thread just before she disappeared.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_31.wav|Vertin|en|Nothing's happened.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_32.wav|Vertin|en|Laplace wants to see me as soon as possible. We'll visit again soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_33.wav|Vertin|en|Is that Merel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_34.wav|Vertin|en|Just stop by the nearest Foundation branch and tell them you're a friend of the Timekeeper, they'll know how to reach me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_35.wav|Vertin|en|What about you? Do you travel much?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_36.wav|Vertin|en|We should probably get going. Once again, we're sorry for disturbing you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_37.wav|Vertin|en|Yes, ma'am. There's no use waiting around here. We should head out and explore the era.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_38.wav|Vertin|en|Where's Merel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_39.wav|Vertin|en|I see.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_4.wav|Vertin|en|Madame Bouanich predicted you'd wake up sometime today, so we thought we'd drop by. I'm sure you want to hear about the school.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_40.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you, Madam Z.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_42.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto and I thought you'd appreciate this.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_44.wav|Vertin|en|Am I interrupting? Looks like you're experimenting with that incantation I learned from the "boon."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_45.wav|Vertin|en|I won't—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_46.wav|Vertin|en|We've got a few more "get well" presents for you. Probably easier if we show them to you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_47.wav|Vertin|en|You can read it like a storybook.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_48.wav|Vertin|en|No. Quite the opposite. You seem more alive than ever.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_49.wav|Vertin|en|Lavender brought it over when she came to visit. She said the students are all wishing you a quick recovery.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_5.wav|Vertin|en|They're heading north. Come on. We should follow them.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_50.wav|Vertin|en|Oh. I remember you mentioned you were looking for ideas for a new name? Any luck so far?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_51.wav|Vertin|en|Tylwyth Teg sight? I suppose that's reason enough to give it a try.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_52.wav|Vertin|en|I'm the Timekeeper of the St. Pavlov Foundation, and this is Sonetto, my assistant.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_53.wav|Vertin|en|You need to rest. Just lie down for now. Your mother will be here soon.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_54.wav|Vertin|en|Merel?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_55.wav|Vertin|en|Oh. Nothing. I just sensed something different about you.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter13_part04_56.wav|Vertin|en|J? Yes. He went to great lengths to sneak them in.
