/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_47.wav|Vertin|en|Where did the Physician go? Wait.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_49.wav|Vertin|en|Huh?
