/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_53.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, help me get him up. Let's get out of here.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_54.wav|Vertin|en|Thank you for your assistance too, Recoleta. Perhaps you'll consider joining the—
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_55.wav|Vertin|en|Signed "Urd." This is a letter from Dr. Dores.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_56.wav|Vertin|en|A letter ... The way you speak is quite different from Dr. Merlin.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_57.wav|Vertin|en|Is he performing surgery?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_58.wav|Vertin|en|The distortion is getting worse. Prepare yourselves to fight or flee.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_59.wav|Vertin|en|You know about the "Storm."
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_6.wav|Vertin|en|"Dear Urd,"
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_60.wav|Vertin|en|Wait, this is ... Ms. Recoleta, is what he said true?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_61.wav|Vertin|en|I'm so glad to see you're safe.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_62.wav|Vertin|en|You helped her leave the Panopticon in the end. Where did she go?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_63.wav|Vertin|en|And if we ask, you'll answer us, without holding anything back?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_7.wav|Vertin|en|Then it hasn't been long since she left. Excellent news.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_8.wav|Vertin|en|But allow me to make a guess: You're Dr. Merlin, aren't you?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043chapter9_part03_9.wav|Vertin|en|Sonetto, let's go.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_1.wav|Vertin|en|The name is Urd.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_10.wav|Vertin|en|That is a high praise.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_11.wav|Vertin|en|Certainly, we can chat a little.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_12.wav|Vertin|en|There is no twist ball, Matilda.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_13.wav|Vertin|en|That pattern is called the Pythagoras tree.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_14.wav|Vertin|en|What's in it?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_15.wav|Vertin|en|Twist ball?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_2.wav|Vertin|en|... I can't be sure. It's just a gut feeling.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_3.wav|Vertin|en|What?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_4.wav|Vertin|en|Of course. Leave it to me.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_5.wav|Vertin|en|Perhaps she forgot that she was supposed to hold the ball.
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_6.wav|Vertin|en|What about rainbow?
/data/admin4/dataset/hero5043/WAV/plotvoc_hero5043newworld_chapter7_7.wav|Vertin|en|I'm underage too.
